ss: we can keep vote A, but note need to discuss others.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 2 that we need more info on others, but I still think A is best given current evidence. Mention that A's anticipation, spatial vision, leadership are strong, while concerns are noted but not as severe as others' egocentric or hot temper. So maintain vote A.\n\nProvide metadata JSON with vote Candidate A.\n\nProceed."}
